    {
      "label": "MergeSort() 분할·재귀·병합 부분",
      "code": "MiddleIndex = (StartIndex + EndIndex) / 2;\n\nMergeSort( DataSet, StartIndex, MiddleIndex );\nMergeSort( DataSet, MiddleIndex+1, EndIndex );\n\nMerge( DataSet, StartIndex, MiddleIndex, EndIndex );",
      "refs": [
